### 1. Default tax report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/tax/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/tax/?start_date=2026-01-01&end_date=2026-10-23
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Monthly graph year
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/tax/?chart_year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Sales invoices only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/tax/?invoice_type=sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Purchase bills only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/tax/?invoice_type=purchase
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Customer filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/tax/?customer=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Vendor filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/tax/?vendor=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Document status filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/tax/?tax_status=paid
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/tax/?page=2&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Combined filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/tax/?start_date=2026-01-01&end_date=2026-10-23&invoice_type=sales&customer=1&chart_year=2026&page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. GST filter (not supported by current models)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/tax/?tax_type=gst
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Invalid date
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/tax/?start_date=invalid-date
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
